@host = http://localhost:5217

### 1 all restaurants: 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants

### 2 Bole, page 2: 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants?area=Bole&page=2&limit=5

### 3 a typo in a parameter name: 400 UNKNOWN_PARAMETER
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants?aera=Bole

### 4 limit out of range: 400 INVALID_PAGING
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants?limit=0

### 5 not a number: 400 VALIDATION_FAILED with an errors object
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants?page=abc

### 6 no such restaurant: 404 RESTAURANT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants/9999

### 7 fails the :int constraint: 404, no route matches (empty body)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants/abc

### 8 a restaurant's menu, paged: 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants/1/menu

### 9 nothing in that category: 200 with an empty data array
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants/1/menu?category=Dessert

### 10 menu of a restaurant that does not exist: 404 RESTAURANT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants/9999/menu

### 11 menu items, filtered: 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/menu-items?category=Drinks&limit=5

### 12 no such menu item: 404 MENU_ITEM_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/api/v1/menu-items/9999

### 13 create a menu item: 201 and a Location header
POST {{host}}/api/v1/menu-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Genfo",
  "category": "Breakfast",
  "priceEtb": 95
}

### 14 a price of zero parses fine but breaks a rule: 422 AMOUNT_INVALID
POST {{host}}/api/v1/menu-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Genfo",
  "category": "Breakfast",
  "priceEtb": 0
}

### 15 a blank name: 400 VALIDATION_FAILED with errors.name
POST {{host}}/api/v1/menu-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "category": "Drinks",
  "priceEtb": 50
}

### 16 place an order: 201 and a Location header (run this before request 25)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "menuItemId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### 17 quantity zero: 422 AMOUNT_INVALID
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "menuItemId": 1,
  "quantity": 0
}

### 18 unknown restaurant: 404 RESTAURANT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 9999,
  "menuItemId": 1,
  "quantity": 1
}

### 19 closed restaurant (Blue Nile): 409 RESTAURANT_CLOSED
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 2,
  "menuItemId": 7,
  "quantity": 1
}

### 20 item 13 belongs to restaurant 3: 422 ITEM_NOT_ON_MENU
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "menuItemId": 13,
  "quantity": 1
}

### 21 a body that cannot be parsed: 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": "one"
}

### 22 read an order: 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/1

### 23 no such order: 404 ORDER_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/999

### 24 move forward (order 2 is Preparing): 200, then run it again for a 409
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/orders/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "OnTheWay"
}

### 25 order 1 is Delivered, so this move is refused: 409 ORDER_STATUS_CONFLICT
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Preparing"
}

### 26 PATCH does not cancel: 409 ORDER_STATUS_CONFLICT (use DELETE)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/orders/3/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Cancelled"
}

### 27 cancel order 3 (created by request 16): 204 with no body
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/orders/3

### 28 cancel it again: 204 again (DELETE is idempotent)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/orders/3

### 29 cancel a delivered order: 409 ORDER_ALREADY_DELIVERED
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/orders/1

### 30 cancel an order that does not exist: 404 ORDER_NOT_FOUND
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/orders/999
